---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { infrastructure } from '../data/site';
---

<Section
  id="infrastructure"
  eyebrow="Infrastructure"
  title="Production readiness"
  subtitle="Immutable deployments, GitOps delivery and a secure software supply chain. No manual deployments exist — everything is reproducible from Git."
>
  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
    {
      infrastructure.map((item, i) => (
        <div
          class="reveal rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-primary/40"
          style={`transition-delay: ${(i % 4) * 60}ms`}
        >
          <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">{item.name}</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{item.tool}</p>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <div class="reveal mt-12 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-surface/60 p-8">
    <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-foreground">
      Delivery model
    </h3>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-muted">
      <span class="rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-card px-3 py-1.5">Developer</span>
      <span class="text-accent">→</span>
      <span class="rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-card px-3 py-1.5">GitHub</span>
      <span class="text-accent">→</span>
      <span class="rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-card px-3 py-1.5">GitHub Actions</span>
      <span class="text-accent">→</span>
      <span class="rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-card px-3 py-1.5">GHCR</span>
      <span class="text-accent">→</span>
      <span class="rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-card px-3 py-1.5">GitOps Repo</span>
      <span class="text-accent">→</span>
      <span class="rounded-md border border-primary/40 bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-accent">Argo CD</span>
      <span class="text-accent">→</span>
      <span class="rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-card px-3 py-1.5">Kubernetes</span>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
      The CI pipeline builds and validates. The CD pipeline never deploys directly — it updates
      the GitOps repository and Argo CD synchronizes Kubernetes with the desired state. Each
      environment (dev / pre / stage / prod) is a thin overlay over a shared base.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>
